# Stretched H2 as in complex_orbs_h2_instability, but with the orbitals
# blocked by parity: the broken-symmetry solution mixes sigma_g and
# sigma_u, so the spin-symmetric 1Sigma_g+ solution is now stable.
System H2_stretched.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method HF
Multiplicity 1
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
InversionSymmetry true
JKMethod Cholesky
ConvThr 1e-8
TrustRegion true
StabilityAnalysis true
SaveChk complex_orbs_h2_inversion.chk
